  "instructions": [
    "1. Heat the vegetable oil in a large skillet or wok over medium-high heat.",
    "2. Add the lamb and cook until browned, about 3-4 minutes.",
    "3. Add the sliced onion, bell pepper, and mushrooms, and cook until the vegetables are tender.",
    "4. In a small bowl, mix together the soy sauce, Saudi arabian pepper, and xtra fry mix.",
    "5. Add the sauce to the lamb and vegetables, and stir to combine.",
    "6. Cook for an additional 2-3 minutes, until the sauce has thickened.",
    "7. Serve hot over rice or noodles."
